OL,3,AMove to rejoin EU among options for UK,
OL,4,Asays Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has suggested rejoining
OL,7,Fthe EU is among options the government
OL,8,Fcould examine to reshape the UK's
OL,9,Flong-term relationship with Europe.
OL,11,FThe prime minister told the BBC the
OL,12,Fcurrent Brexit settlement had caused
OL,13,F"more harm than good" and he wanted to
OL,14,Flook at "what is doable" to repair
OL,15,Frelations.
OL,17,FIt comes after he pledged in his Labour
OL,18,Fconference speech on Tuesday to explore
OL,19,Fcloser ties with the bloc at a delayed
OL,20,Fsummit later this year.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
