OL,3,ASouth Africa to clean up high-risk
OL,4,Aareas after 12 women killed
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Africa's President Cyril
OL,7,FRamaphosa on Tuesday announced a
OL,8,Fclean-up of high-risk areas across the
OL,9,Fcountry, after the bodies of 12 women
OL,10,Fwere discovered in an area east of
OL,11,FJohannesburg in just two months.
OL,13,FThe deaths sparked a national outcry
OL,14,Fabout the scale of violence against
OL,15,Fwomen in South Africa, which has one of
OL,16,Fthe highest rates of gender-based
OL,17,Fviolence in the world.
OL,19,FRamaphosa announced what he called a
OL,20,Fmultidisciplinary, national-level
OL,21,Femergency response to the murders, for
OL,22,Fwhich there have been four arrests.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
